  "notes": "Slug gpt-oss-1 because gpt-oss would equal the family id openai.gpt-oss. gpt-oss-120b and gpt-oss-20b were released together under one name stem, so they are inline variants; parameters are recorded per variant. OpenAI calls these its first open-weight language models since GPT-2, and the model card says the architecture builds on GPT-2 and GPT-3; neither is a lineage claim, so no relation is recorded. The bare alias gpt-oss is candidate because it is also the family name."
